        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DSBP45, 4-1/2\" x 4-1/2\"  x Square Corners Solid Brass Ornate Hinge Pair</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes a pair of hinges (2), matching solid brass flathead, Phillips Drive #12 x 1-1/4\" wood screws and standard removable button tip finials. Square Corners, 3 Knuckle for smooth action, .168\" thick (Gauge). \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"350\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSBP45.jpg?v=1704354782\" width=\"350\" height=\"391\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DSBP45 Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes a pair of hinges, matching solid brass slotted flathead, 12 x 1-1/4\" wood screws and decorative finials.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFitted with a high grade, removable, rust resistant, stainless steel pin.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 4-1/2 Inch Decorative Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height:4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.168\"</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #12 x 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSBP45.pdf?v=1704262216\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DSBP45 Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe offer different <a href=\"/pages/deltana-finish-colors\">finishes</a>, but no matter which finish you choose, the base metal will still be <b>High Quality Solid Brass</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold in Pairs (2 Door Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "4-1/2 x 4-1/2 Ornate Brass Hinge With Finials, Pair, Deltana DSBP45",
                "description": "Deltana DSBP45 4-1/2 x 4-1/2 Solid Brass Ornate Hinges. 3 Knuckle design for smooth action, .168 thick. These decorative door hinges are offered in 10 different finishes including oil rubbed bronze, black, satin nickel and antique brass.  ",
